# Files that define a project's checks, one glob per line.
# A glob is matched against the full path and the file name.
# A change to any of them is a protected-change flag in the gate.
# package.json is flagged only when its scripts change.
# A project adds its own paths on the "Protected paths" line of docs/agents/dev-loop.md.
